{
 "id": "tcp",
 "acts": [
  {
   "key": "normal",
   "no": "第 1 幕",
   "title": "它正常怎么工作",
   "desc": "三次握手、传输、挥手：整条连接的状态只记在两个序号里",
   "lead": "先看它跑通一次。注意两件事：序号决定顺序，标志位决定状态。",
   "scenes": [
    {
     "name": "建连 → 传数据 → 挥手",
     "steps": [
      {
       "who": "客户端",
       "to": "服务器",
       "pkt": 0,
       "bubble": "SYN",
       "hl": [
        "Source Port",
        "Sequence Number",
        "Flags"
       ],
       "vals": {
        "Source Port": "49572",
        "Destination Port": "443",
        "Sequence Number": "x = 0x3a2c17",
        "Flags": "SYN",
        "Acknowledgment Number": "0"
       },
       "say": "客户端挑一个随机源端口，把初始序号 x 放进首部，只置 SYN 标志。",
       "sub": "此时双方还没有任何连接状态，服务器不知道这是新客户还是重传。",
       "p": {
        "src": "192.168.1.100",
        "dst": "93.184.216.34",
        "sport": 49572,
        "dport": 443,
        "seq": 3812375,
        "ack": 0,
        "flags": "S",
        "win": 64240,
        "payload": "",
        "opts": "syn"
       }
      },
      {
       "who": "服务器",
       "to": "客户端",
       "pkt": 0,
       "bubble": "SYN+ACK",
       "hl": [
        "Sequence Number",
        "Acknowledgment Number",
        "Flags",
        "MSS Option"
       ],
       "vals": {
        "Source Port": "443",
        "Destination Port": "49572",
        "Sequence Number": "y = 0x8f2b41",
        "Acknowledgment Number": "x+1",
        "Flags": "SYN, ACK",
        "MSS Option": "1460"
       },
       "say": "服务器回自己的序号 y，并确认 x+1；顺手用 MSS 选项报出能收多大段。",
       "sub": "这一步服务器已经为连接分配了 TCB（传输控制块）——资源在验证对端之前就花掉了。",
       "p": {
        "src": "93.184.216.34",
        "dst": "192.168.1.100",
        "sport": 443,
        "dport": 49572,
        "seq": 9382721,
        "ack": 3812376,
        "flags": "SA",
        "win": 65160,
        "payload": "",
        "opts": "syn"
       }
      },
      {
       "who": "客户端",
       "to": "服务器",
       "pkt": 0,
       "bubble": "ACK",
       "hl": [
        "Acknowledgment Number",
        "Flags"
       ],
       "vals": {
        "Sequence Number": "x+1",
        "Acknowledgment Number": "y+1",
        "Flags": "ACK"
       },
       "say": "第三次握手是一个裸 ACK：确认 y+1，连接进入 ESTABLISHED。",
       "sub": "SYN 和 FIN 各占 1 个序号，所以下一个字节从 x+1 开始。",
       "p": {
        "src": "192.168.1.100",
        "dst": "93.184.216.34",
        "sport": 49572,
        "dport": 443,
        "seq": 3812376,
        "ack": 9382722,
        "flags": "A",
        "win": 64240,
        "payload": "",
        "opts": ""
       }
      },
      {
       "who": "客户端",
       "to": "服务器",
       "pkt": 0,
       "bubble": "PSH+ACK",
       "hl": [
        "Sequence Number",
        "Acknowledgment Number",
        "Checksum"
       ],
       "vals": {
        "Sequence Number": "x+1",
        "Acknowledgment Number": "y+1",
        "Flags": "PSH, ACK",
        "Checksum": "0x7c00"
       },
       "say": "数据按字节编号：发出 200 字节，序号仍从 x+1 起，一个字节一个号。",
       "sub": "校验和覆盖「伪首部 + 首部 + 数据」，伪首部里的源/目的 IP 让它无法被单独伪造。",
       "p": {
        "src": "192.168.1.100",
        "dst": "93.184.216.34",
        "sport": 49572,
        "dport": 443,
        "seq": 3812376,
        "ack": 9382722,
        "flags": "PA",
        "win": 64240,
        "payload": "GET / HTTP/1.1\r\n",
        "opts": ""
       }
      },
      {
       "who": "服务器",
       "to": "客户端",
       "pkt": 0,
       "bubble": "ACK",
       "hl": [
        "Acknowledgment Number",
        "Window"
       ],
       "vals": {
        "Sequence Number": "y+1",
        "Acknowledgment Number": "x+201",
        "Flags": "ACK",
        "Window": "0xfaf0"
       },
       "say": "服务器确认到 x+201：确认号永远表示「我下一个想要的字节」。",
       "sub": "窗口字段告诉对方还能发多少——这个数字直接决定吞吐，也决定泄漏多少缓冲信息。",
       "p": {
        "src": "93.184.216.34",
        "dst": "192.168.1.100",
        "sport": 443,
        "dport": 49572,
        "seq": 9382722,
        "ack": 3812392,
        "flags": "A",
        "win": 64240,
        "payload": "",
        "opts": ""
       }
      },
      {
       "who": "客户端",
       "to": "服务器",
       "pkt": 0,
       "bubble": "FIN+ACK",
       "hl": [
        "Flags",
        "Sequence Number"
       ],
       "vals": {
        "Sequence Number": "x+201",
        "Acknowledgment Number": "y+1",
        "Flags": "FIN, ACK"
       },
       "say": "传完了发 FIN；双方各确认一次，主动关闭方进入 TIME_WAIT 等 2MSL。",
       "sub": "TIME_WAIT 不是为了礼貌：它让迟到的旧报文自然死掉，也让最后的 ACK 有重传机会。",
       "p": {
        "src": "192.168.1.100",
        "dst": "93.184.216.34",
        "sport": 49572,
        "dport": 443,
        "seq": 3812392,
        "ack": 9382722,
        "flags": "FA",
        "win": 64240,
        "payload": "",
        "opts": ""
       }
      }
